  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centre of Excellence for Biodiversity and Ecosystems management in Eastern and Southern Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of the project is to ensure forest and biodiversity ecosystems in Eastern and Southern Africa are sustainably managed and continue providing ecosystem services and contribute to the well-being of the populations, by providing improved, regular and updated information for informed decision making.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
